stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> WaitingForInput

    state "Phase 1: Waiting for input" as WaitingForInput
    state "Phase 2: Active mission" as ActiveMission

    WaitingForInput --> ActiveMission: MSG_COLOUR green / bill / sauce

    state ActiveMission {
        [*] --> LookingForGreen
        state "10: Looking for green" as LookingForGreen
        state "11: Found green" as FoundGreen
        state "12: Looking for red" as LookingForRed
        state "13: Return to red" as ReturnToRed
        state "14: Waiting" as Waiting

        LookingForGreen --> FoundGreen: green centered and distance < 15
        FoundGreen --> LookingForRed: immediate
        LookingForRed --> ReturnToRed: red detected steady
        ReturnToRed --> Waiting: at red location for 3 s
        Waiting --> Waiting: tbot.stop

        LookingForGreen --> LookingForGreen: green off-center or not found
        LookingForRed --> LookingForRed: red off-center or not found
        ReturnToRed --> ReturnToRed: keep moving toward red
    }

    state "Chef sends green after food" as ChefReply
    state "Waiter sends found" as WaiterReply
    state "Confirmation messages" as Confirmation

    ChefReply --> WaiterReply
    WaiterReply --> Confirmation
    Confirmation --> Confirmation


